visional","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p039:m0098","kind":"person","start":98,"end":103,"surface":"臨海王子頊","person_id":"83f_ecc_ef1","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p039:m0125","kind":"person","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"義慶","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p039:m0149","kind":"person","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"太祖","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p039:m0183","kind":"person","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"曄王建","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBB","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"「子曄王建」無標點且本批不據常見本重斷；保留此人名候選，不指認或推定王建的關係。","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039","interpretation_note":"武英殿轉錄保留「曄王建」原字；識典古籍卷五十一對讀作「哀王燁」，僅作同一劉燁人物之候選讀法。頁36定點圖像核字未完成；不把此三字切成兩個人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p039:m0207","kind":"person","start":207,"end":208,"surface":"綽","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBBA","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"本傳可見「子綽」，但前句讀法/親屬指向未定；只標本字候選，不補父、姓或世次。","source_role_key":"song051-p029-p039","interpretation_note":"本段「子綽」明示為前述人物之子；與同卷下一欄「字子流嗣」接讀，識別為劉綽、字子流。此處只新增 p039 提及，不新增 p040 標註。"}],"source_position":{"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/song051-wyd1739-zongshi/transcription-projection.json","raw_file_sha256":"aa7b16d610871f77b747adbe0edb84f8775e1d404140a1e3f6284dccd11aaa45","unit_key":"unit039","source_layer":"received_chapter","first_line":377,"last_line":386},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","book_id":"b-songshu-051","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-051","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","source":{"title":"宋書卷五十一，清乾隆四年武英殿本（NLC善本09753）","provider":